{"answer":null,"concept_id":"hip-memcpy-implicit-sync-diff","content_sha256":"sha256:46cb0a38af720b0f13dbc4ccdda1188cc9ed6d5faae42273b05a39cc791f2f65","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789365708.1346612,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有 HIP 移植不能只看编译。补运行时语义差。","id":"q-operator-rocm-implicit-sync-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"HIP 默认流、hipMemcpy 同步语义、内存类型（pageable vs pinned/hipHostMalloc）与 CUDA 不完全同构。假设\"API 同名即同语义\"会把隐藏同步带回。要用 rocprof/时间线对拍，而不是只 diff 源码"},{"id":"b","text":"HIP 不能重叠拷贝与计算，这是架构限制"},{"id":"c","text":"只要文件扩展名改成 .hip 就会自动重叠"},{"id":"d","text":"只有改用 Unified Memory 才能在 HIP 上重叠"}],"prompt":"同一套\"多 stream 重叠\"代码 CUDA 上能叠、HIP 上变同步。除了 wavefront，还应查什么？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"HIP Porting Guide","url":"https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/HIP/en/latest/how-to/hip_porting_guide.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"rocm-memory","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
